"Deteksi titik api/titik panas resmi NASA FIRMS dari semua satelit VIIRS dan MODIS, untuk seluruh dunia (hari terpilih dan hari sebelumnya). Berguna untuk lokasi di luar Kapuas Hulu.": "Official NASA FIRMS fire/hotspot detections from all VIIRS and MODIS satellites, worldwide (selected day and the day before). Useful for locations outside Kapuas Hulu.",
"Citra satelit harian (warna asli)": "Daily satellite imagery (true colour)",
"Citra harian VIIRS": "VIIRS daily imagery",
"Foto satelit hari itu (VIIRS NOAA-20; sebelum 2018: MODIS Terra): asap, awan, dan bekas terbakar besar terlihat langsung. Resolusi ±250–375 m.": "Satellite photo of that day (VIIRS NOAA-20; before 2018: MODIS Terra): smoke, clouds and large burn scars are directly visible. Resolution ±250–375 m.",
"Citra harian MODIS Terra": "MODIS Terra daily imagery",
"Karbon monoksida (CO) dari asap": "Carbon monoxide (CO) from smoke",
"Gas CO di ketinggian ±5,5 km dari satelit AIRS (Aqua), seperti tampilan NASA Eyes on the Earth. Gabungan 3 hari pengamatan (sampai tanggal terpilih) agar celah lintasan satelit tertutup. Merah/ungu = asap kebakaran tebal. Resolusi ±45 km.": "CO gas at ±5.5 km altitude from the AIRS satellite (Aqua), like the NASA Eyes on the Earth view. A 3-day composite of observations (up to the selected date) so that gaps between satellite tracks are filled. Red/purple = thick fire smoke. Resolution ±45 km.",
"Ketebalan kabut asap (AOD) · VIIRS": "Smoke haze thickness (AOD) · VIIRS",
"Aerosol Optical Depth hasil pengamatan satelit VIIRS (S-NPP & NOAA-20, algoritma Deep Blue), gabungan 2 lintasan. Makin merah = makin pekat asap/partikel. Catatan: asap yang sangat tebal atau tertutup awan kadang tidak terbaca satelit (tampak kosong); gunakan lapisan CAMS di bawah untuk peta tanpa celah.": "Aerosol Optical Depth observed by the VIIRS satellites (S-NPP & NOAA-20, Deep Blue algorithm), a composite of 2 passes. The redder, the denser the smoke/particles. Note: very thick smoke or cloud cover is sometimes not read by the satellite (appears empty); use the CAMS layer below for a gap-free map.",
"Ketebalan aerosol dari pembakaran biomassa (kebakaran hutan & lahan) menurut model Copernicus CAMS (ECMWF), per 3 jam, termasuk prakiraan 4–5 hari ke depan. Hanya nilai ≥ 0,36 (asap nyata) yang diwarnai, sisanya dibiarkan transparan agar citra satelit asli tetap terlihat. Hasil model (grid ±40 km), bukan pengamatan langsung.": "Aerosol thickness from biomass burning (forest & land fires) according to the Copernicus CAMS model (ECMWF), every 3 hours, including a 4–5 day forecast. Only values ≥ 0.36 (real smoke) are coloured; the rest is left transparent so the real satellite imagery stays visible. Model output (±40 km grid), not a direct observation.",
"Konsentrasi partikel halus PM2.5 di permukaan (µg/m³) menurut model Copernicus CAMS (ECMWF), per 3 jam, termasuk prakiraan. Hanya nilai ≥ 36 µg/m³ (di atas kategori “rendah” DAQI) yang diwarnai, sisanya transparan agar citra asli terlihat. Hasil model, bukan alat ukur.": "Surface concentration of fine particles PM2.5 (µg/m³) according to the Copernicus CAMS model (ECMWF), every 3 hours, including forecasts. Only values ≥ 36 µg/m³ (above the DAQI “low” category) are coloured; the rest is transparent so the real imagery is visible. Model output, not a measuring instrument.",
